
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
DataType                           	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Document                           	N/A                 	N/A       
DriverName                         	N/A                 	N/A       
ElapsedTime                        	N/A                 	N/A       
HostPrintQueue                     	N/A                 	N/A       
InstallDate                        	N/A                 	N/A       
JobId                              	N/A                 	N/A       
JobStatus                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
Notify                             	N/A                 	N/A       
Owner                              	N/A                 	N/A       
PagesPrinted                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Parameters                         	N/A                 	N/A       
PrintProcessor                     	N/A                 	N/A       
Priority                           	N/A                 	N/A       
Size                               	N/A                 	N/A       
StartTime                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Status                             	N/A                 	N/A       
StatusMask                         	N/A                 	N/A       
TimeSubmitted                      	N/A                 	N/A       
TotalPages                         	N/A                 	N/A       
UntilTime                          	N/A                 	N/A       

